    "turn_text": "Yeah, that's exactly right. So the House Democrats bill the Justice and Policing Act would actually end qualified immunity if passed. And then Democratic Congresswoman Ayanna Presley alongside libertarian rep Justin Amash have been leaders on this issue in their own right, writing their own bill specifically about ending this. We spoke with Presley yesterday about why she's working on qualified immunity, what else needs to be done here, and what she makes of this inflection point in history. Here's a little bit of that conversation.",
